{"sections":[{"slug":"形式概形","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"形式概形"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">形式概形</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"形式概形"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">形式概形是</span> “"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/形式邻域","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">形式邻域</span>"}},{"Plain":"”.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">形式概形是</span> $\\mathsf {Fun}(\\mathsf {Ring},\\mathsf {Set})$ <span lang=\"zh\">中</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/滤余极限","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">滤余极限</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">函子</span> $X\\colon \\mathsf {Ring}\\to\\mathsf {Set}$ <span lang=\"zh\">构成形式概形当且仅当</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>$X$ <span lang=\"zh\">保持有限极限</span>;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">存在一族概形</span> $X_i$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及态射</span> $X_i\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">使得对任意环</span> $R$, $\\bigsqcup_iX_i(R)\\to X(R)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为满射</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">形式概形的范畴具有一切</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/余极限","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">余极限</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴到形式概形的含入保持有限余极限</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>${\\widehat{\\mathbb{A}^1}} \\colon R\\mapsto \\operatorname{Nil}R=\\{r\\in R\\mid\\exists n,r^n=0\\}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是最基本的形式概形</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">它是滤余极限</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{colim}_n\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb{Z}[x]/(x^n).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Lie代数","text":"Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出形式概形</span> $\\exp (\\mathfrak g)$: <span lang=\"zh\">作为函子</span> $\\mathsf{Ring} \\to \\mathsf{Set}$, <span lang=\"zh\">它是</span>\n$$\r\nR \\mapsto \r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/形式谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">形式谱</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}